      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed particle-strengthening mechanisms will improve high-temperature mechanical performance under creep or sustained loading at approximately 800–1100°C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-modified alloy will exhibit an approximately 10–20% increase in high-temperature yield strength relative to the Hf-free base alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-modified alloy will exhibit an approximately 10–20% improvement in creep resistance relative to the Hf-free base alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A 0.5–1 at% Hf addition will produce only a negligible density increase.",
