      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A 0.5–1 at% Hf addition will preserve room-temperature mechanical performance at a level comparable to the base alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf contents above the optimal range may cause excessive precipitate formation and limit the improvement.",
